OL,3,GNEWSAMan cautioned after hit-and-run
OL,4,Aincident involving child
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has received a police caution
OL,7,Fafter a hit-and-run incident involving
OL,8,Fa child pedestrian in Armagh.
OL,10,FThe boy was taken to hospital after the
OL,11,Fincident which involved a silver
OL,12,FVolkswagen Golf, on the Newry Road at
OL,13,Fabout 14:30 GMT on Saturday.
OL,15,FThe child has since been discharged
OL,16,Ffrom hospital.
OL,18,FA 75-year-old man has been cautioned on
OL,19,Fsuspicion of a number of driving
OL,20,Foffences, police said.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
